trength. A small value bet of 100 chips allows me to extract value from weaker holdings (pairs of 6s, single pair worse than my 8s, or missed draws) while minimizing my loss if they wake up with a King or better. This balanced approach is superior to checking, which gives up potential value, especially since I'm currently down 150 chips cumulatively and need to capitalize on winning opportunities.\n\nAnswer: 100"}
